{"timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:47:24.164Z","ordinal":56,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a19b70-7336-77f2-a5a5-f8aefbea889b","turn_id":"01a19b70-7341-7e12-98d5-3e6b1c15e0f0","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"call_01a19b7112b9750c85e07509","process_id":"32574","command":["/bin/bash","-lc","cd /media/manu/1TB-Volume/workspace/ultralytics && echo \"=== track_fusion.py vs eval_bidirectional_track_fusion.py ===\" && ls -la manu/tracking/lookahead/ && echo \"---\" && diff -u manu/evaluation/eval_bidirectional_track_fusion.py manu/tracking/lookahead/track_fusion.py 2>&1 | head -60 && echo \"DIFFRC=$?\""],"cwd":"file:///media/manu/1TB-Volume/workspace","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"cd /media/manu/1TB-Volume/workspace/ultralytics && echo \"=== track_fusion.py vs eval_bidirectional_track_fusion.py ===\" && ls -la manu/tracking/lookahead/ && echo \"---\" && diff -u manu/evaluation/eval_bidirectional_track_fusion.py manu/tracking/lookahead/track_fusion.py 2>&1 | head -60 && echo \"DIFFRC=$?\""}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"=== track_fusion.py vs eval_bidirectional_track_fusion.py ===\ntotal 216\ndrwxrwxr-x 3 manu manu  4096 Nov  2 16:12 .\ndrwxrwxr-x 6 manu manu  4096 Nov  2 14:49 ..\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 manu manu 29682 Nov  2 15:45 README.md\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 manu manu   703 Nov  2 14:49 __init__.py\ndrwxrwxr-x 2 manu manu  4096 Nov  2 16:47 __pycache__\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 manu manu 37102 Nov  2 16:42 extrapolator.py\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 manu manu 53917 Nov  2 16:42 lookahead_longquan.py\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 manu manu 57494 Nov  2 16:03 track_fusion.py\n-rw-rw-r-- 1 manu manu 10882 Nov  2 16:14 tune_kernel.py\n---\n--- manu/evaluation/eval_bidirectional_track_fusion.py\t2026-09-24 10:39:08.008756903 +0800\n+++ manu/tracking/lookahead/track_fusion.py\t2026-11-02 16:03:41.935253914 +0800\n@@ -3,6 +3,10 @@\n \"\"\"\n Bidirectional Spatio-Temporal Smoothed Track Fusion System for Trial 22 (Scheme 1 SOTA)\n \n+本文件是 ``manu/evaluation/eval_bidirectional_track_fusion.py`` 的拷贝，为「快速前向推演外挂」加挂了\n+KF 状态捕获；原文件不得修改。除 ``evaluate_sequence_bidirectional`` 新增的 ``capture_kf_states``\n+开关外，这里的既有算术与原文件逐字保持——外挂必须做到「关掉开关 ⇒ 与原脚本逐位一致」。\n+\n Key Algorithmic Breakthroughs over Baseline Fusion:\n 1. Two-Tier Kinematic Online Association & Hover Exemption (Inherited from Trial 22 SOTA):\n    - Tier 1: Strong seeds (conf >= th_base) initiate tracks.\n@@ -47,7 +51,7 @@\n import numpy as np\n from scipy.optimize import linear_sum_assignment\n \n-PROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]\n+PROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[3]\n if str(PROJECT_ROOT) not in sys.path:\n     sys.path.insert(0, str(PROJECT_ROOT))\n \n@@ -750,6 +754,7 @@\n     size_gate: float = 40.0,\n     bbox_conf_min: float = 0.40,\n     bbox_dedup_radius: float = 20.0,\n+    capture_kf_states: bool = False,\n ) -> Dict[str, Dict[str, float]]:\n     if tracker_config is None:\n         tracker_config = {\n@@ -796,6 +801,9 @@\n     sky_y_boundary = img_h * sky_ratio\n     th_deep = float(tracker_config.get(\"th_deep_salvage\", 0.0))\n \n+    # 快速前向推演外挂要读 KF 的位置与速度；只有外挂打开时才捕获，默认路径不做这份拷贝。\n+    kf_states: Dict[int, Dict[int, Tuple[np.ndarray, np.ndarray]]] = {}\n+\n     # Pass 1: Run online tracking across all frames\n     for f_idx, r in enumerate(records_sorted):\n         pred_pts = np.asarray(r[\"pred_points\"], dtype=np.float32)\n@@ -844,6 +852,19 @@\n \n         online_tracker.step(f_idx, high_pts, high_scs, salvage_pts, salvage_scs, deep_pts, deep_scs)\n \n+        if capture_kf_states:\n+            # 捕获点必须落在 step 之后：此刻的 KF 状态才是「本帧上报所依据的估计」。\n+            kf_states[f_idx] = {\n+                # (位置, 速度, 协方差)：协方差只读，用于外挂里「递推卡尔曼状态」时的\n+                # 增益计算；读取 P 不改变本管线的任何算术。\n+                int(trk.track_id): (\n+                    trk.get_pos().copy(),\n+                    trk.get_velocity().copy(),\n+                    np.asarray(trk.P, dtype=np.float32).copy(),\n+                )\n+                for trk in list(online_tracker.active_tracks) + list(online_tracker.finished_tracks)\n+            }\n+\n     all_tracks = online_tracker.finalize()\n \n     # Pass 2: Tracklet stitching & Bidirectional Infill\nDIFFRC=0\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":40508}},"started_at_ms":1793609244163,"completed_at_ms":1793609244164}}
